308	     * whitespace to a single space, upper-case, and expand common abbreviations
309	     * ({@code ST -> STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}) whenever
310	     * they appear as whole words. The result is what is stored, returned and used
311	     * for every household comparison; it is idempotent, so re-normalising an
312	     * already-normalised address leaves it unchanged.
